  "description": "We are preparing to run dcm2niix on a DICOM\u2011based dataset. The input source is explicitly a DICOM collection, and the conversion will follow the naming template \u201c%p_%s_%t\u201d for the output files. Lossless scaling is turned off (set to \u201cn\u201d), Philips scaling remains enabled (\u201cy\u201d), and the converter will generate compressed NIfTI files (\u201cy\u201d). No merging of 2\u2011D slices is requested (\u201cn\u201d), single\u2011file mode stays disabled (\u201cn\u201d), and no cropping will be applied (\u201cn\u201d). The process will not anonymize BIDS metadata (\u201cn\u201d), will not create BIDS side\u2011car files (\u201cn\u201d), and private text notes are omitted (\u201cn\u201d). Errors are not to be ignored (ignore_errors\u202f=\u202ffalse), and the pipeline will not attempt to decompress any DICOM files (decompress_dicoms\u202f=\u202ffalse). All series are to be converted (convert_only_series\u202f=\u202fall), derived series are not ignored (\u201cn\u201d), and 3\u2011D volume output is not requested (vol3D\u202f=\u202ffalse)."
